Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=28}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.05,0:01:58.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[GHIN] I don't care how much of a bad ass\Nhe used to be; now he's just a cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:02.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have to break a\Nsweat to kill this old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.94,0:02:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll spare him, but you have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:09.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, don't make this any\Nharder, Sanji. Just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:12.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't force me to kill both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:19.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Run away... Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:20.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.45,0:02:23.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] You look even dumber\Nat gunpoint, Old Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:27.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of example do you think\Nyou're setting for all the other cooks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:31.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hah! I don't need a lecture\Nfrom a brat like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:34.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Would you stop calling me names?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.47,0:02:36.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit treating me like a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:37.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:40.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji wouldn't abandon\NZeff now would he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:44.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Ghin, point that gun at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:45.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:47.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, but what if you die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:49.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.02,0:02:51.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji, why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.98,0:02:54.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PEARL] Someone's eager to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:57.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lucky for you, I'd be\Nmore than happy to oblige.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:02:59.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Allow me...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.99,0:03:03.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure to beat\Nyou to a bloody, lifeless pulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:04.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:06.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[PEARL] The absolutely natural Pearl...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:06.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:08.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}[PEARL] Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:10.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.13,0:03:11.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:14.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you dodge that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.01,0:03:15.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]\NBecause if I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.76,0:03:18.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that rat over there would\Npull the trigger on Zeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:19.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[huffs]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.10,0:03:20.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GHIN] Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:23.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just leave the restaurant\Npeacefully and no one gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:24.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:28.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This restaurant is that old man's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:34.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] I've already taken everything\Nelse that man holds dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:43.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] His power... his dreams...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.37,0:03:46.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]\NSo, while I'm around...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.54,0:03:50.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... I'm not gonna let anything\Nelse get taken from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:52.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.46,0:03:55.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[PEARL] Pearl... Cymbals!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.55,0:03:57.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CARNE] Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:58.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:02.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.01,0:04:03.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,The All Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.85,0:04:05.81,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Yeah! It's out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:09.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'll bet it's even\Nawesomer than they say it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[COOK A] Stop being a doofus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:20.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That's just a fairy tale\Nfor seafaring cooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.53,0:04:21.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[COOK B] Don't get me wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.95,0:04:23.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we've all had our little\Nfantasies about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:26.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but you gotta remember\Nthat it's just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.62,0:04:31.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A dream? Well I'm gonna find the All\NBlue, then we'll see who's dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:33.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's quite the quest. Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right there little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you even know what\Nkind of place the All Blue is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:40.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Yeah, I do. I'm not an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:43.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The All Blue is a place where\Nfish from all four seas live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.97,0:04:49.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}There're fish from East Blue, the West Blue,\Nthe North Blue, and the South Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.94,0:04:54.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To cooks who have taken to the sea,\Nit's an irresistible paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.69,0:04:57.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.19,0:04:59.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah! That place is a goldmine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:02.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's got fish and plants\Nfrom all over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.24,0:05:04.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Any chef would jump at\Nthe chance to cook there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:08.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,True. The cooks I know would\Nrisk life and limb to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:10.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK A] Yeah! Well, if it were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:11.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:14.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You think a miracle sea like the\NAll Blue could actually exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:17.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Think about it kid, it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:21.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[COOK C] Ha, ha! I bet it's probably\Njust a lie told by some daydreaming cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK A] Okay, enough\Nwith the silly stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:26.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get out there and collect\Nsome plates, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:27.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.73,0:05:31.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK A] Aw man. What a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:33.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They left behind plates and plates\Nfull of this delicious grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:35.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK C] This one's barely been touched!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:37.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's pretty good stuff too. I\Nthought they'd love it for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:41.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK B] If you ask me,\Nthe customers these days are spoiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:44.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's way gross to eat\Nthe leftovers of strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.07,0:05:46.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should just let me\Nthrow that stuff away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.28,0:05:50.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}That kind of talk proves you gotta whole lot\Nto learn, so listen up, shorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.20,0:05:53.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you choose life on the high\Nseas, you gotta be resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:56.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ocean is a strange\Nand unpredictable place,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:58.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,where wasting food\Ncould be a fatal mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:01.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, why don't you have some? Heh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:02.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.51,0:06:03.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK II giggles]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:05.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[passengers screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.05,0:06:08.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Calm down, people!\NPanicking won't help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.18,0:06:09.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI, COOKS] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.89,0:06:10.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SAILOR B grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.23,0:06:13.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:16.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS whimper]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:16.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:17.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.74,0:06:21.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SAILOR C] That ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.90,0:06:25.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's Red Foot Zeff\Nand the Cook Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.16,0:06:30.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SAILOR B] They're back...\Nfrom the Grand Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES chuckle]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:44.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I take it you're the\Ninfamous pirate captain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:45.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Red Foot Zeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:48.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Steal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:51.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:55.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Steal everything\Nthat isn't nailed down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:58.56,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[passengers screaming]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.56,0:07:00.40,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Those bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:03.07,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die at the\Nhands of those animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.07,0:07:06.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE 2] Whoa, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:11.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hey, Killer, if you're not careful,\Nyou might just put someone's eye out with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:15.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He got me. Look, I'm bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.00,0:07:18.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You mongrels\Nbetter stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.79,0:07:20.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK A yelps] Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:23.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it! You'll make them mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:28.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ZEFF] A bit young to have a death wish,\Nbut that's no reason not to grant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, you jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:33.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If I'm dying here, then I'm\Ntakin' some of you with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:33.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:34.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.44,0:07:37.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:40.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wow, good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:41.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was brutal!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:46.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES chuckle]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:51.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:55.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] I'm not gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.79,0:07:58.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not here... Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.08,0:08:03.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got to live... so that\NI can find the All Blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:06.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:08.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE 3] He said, "the All Blue!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.84,0:08:11.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE 4] Pretty ambitious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE 1] Oh, that's a good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.35,0:08:17.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey Captain, should we tell the\Nlittle tyke it doesn't exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:18.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.44,0:08:21.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He won't shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.81,0:08:19.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}That fool...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:22.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.94,0:08:32.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna draw my last breath\Nuntil I've seen the All Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:33.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE 3] Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I recommend we withdraw, immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.49,0:08:38.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This storm is way bigger than expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:40.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] All right men, playtime's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:43.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's load up the treasure\Nand get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:49.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:51.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL yelling]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:52.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:56.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.27,0:08:59.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.48,0:09:00.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF grumbles]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.31,0:09:02.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE 2] The captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.69,0:09:10.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.95,0:09:15.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE 5] Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.53,0:09:18.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE 3] Why'd he risk\Nhis life for one measly kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] The brat finally wakes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're lucky to be alive, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:08.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI groans] You!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.09,0:10:10.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Moving isn't a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're still pretty banged up\Nfrom the beating you took.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:13.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.59,0:10:14.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] What about the ships?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.89,0:10:16.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:17.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was terrible storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:20.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our ships were most likely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:22.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seems we're the only survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:28.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Washed ashore on a desolate rock, without\Nso much as a coconut tree to give us food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:30.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sure, there are fish in the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:33.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but the rock has been curved\Nby the waves in such a manner
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:37.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that we wouldn't be able to climb\Nback up, if we ever went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:38.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sad, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:40.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is all your fault, Old Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.83,0:10:42.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.29,0:10:44.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] You can whine all\Nyou want, it won't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:49.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If nobody comes, we'll just dry up\Nand become two more skeletons in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:51.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Skeletons?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:52.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:55.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] That bag there...\NIt's your share of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:56.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:00.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] It's some of the food\Nthat washed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Should be about five days worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:05.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not much, but it's\Nbetter than nothin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:10.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you ration it out, it'll last longer,\Nso use your head when you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:13.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good thing we're both cooks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:16.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that bag your share of the food?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:17.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You got way more than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:20.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fat, old pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:23.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Of course I get more food...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:27.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a grown man, so I need more\Nto survive than a runt like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:32.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You should be grateful that\NI'm sharing any of it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:35.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't expect any pity\Nfrom me, you little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.97,0:11:37.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:39.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:45.94,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Get to the other side of\Nthis rock and watch for ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:48.10,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Let me know as soon as you see one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.10,0:11:51.86,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Until then, don't bother talkin'\Nto me or movin' from your post.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.86,0:11:55.28,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That'll just waste energy,\Nand we can't afford that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:57.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:58.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Screw you, gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:12:01.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying anything\Nif I see a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:04.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. I have five\Nwhole days worth of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.70,0:12:07.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We'll definitely see a ship\Nor two before I run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:08.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:12.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just to be extra safe, I'll\Ndivide it up for twenty days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:14.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's more than enough\Ntime to get rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:18.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess all I gotta\Ndo now is sit and wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:21.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Easy! I'll make it\Nthrough this thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.05,0:12:22.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:33.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:38.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't see a ship today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:42.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's all right.\NIt'll only be a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:50.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] I don't wanna die...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:03.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI weakly]\NThis is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:05.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One moldy piece of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK A] Aw man, what a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.73,0:13:18.90,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,They left behind plates and plates\Nfull of this delicious grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:22.07,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] It's way gross to eat\Nthe leftovers of strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:25.20,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,You should just let me\Nthrow that stuff away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:28.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,So, why don't you have some... huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:31.87,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2040)}[SANJI] No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.59,0:13:39.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– [sniffling]\N– [stomach growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.64,0:13:45.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI yelps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:47.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:51.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.85,0:13:54.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:33.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:36.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is the geezer dead yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:46.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:49.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And he's still got food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A lot of food!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]\NHe's alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:54.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.16,0:14:56.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's so much left!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.84,0:15:02.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've got to get that food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:05.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's not fair that he has\Nso much more than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:08.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Besides, this is all his fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:20.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] What're you doing here, ya' brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:21.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.61,0:15:23.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Are you here\Nbecause ya' saw a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:27.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:30.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I came over here to\Nsteal your food, Old Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:32.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you wanna kill me for it, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:36.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Soon enough I'll starve, so\Nit makes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:39.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:16:01.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Didn't I tell you not to come\Nover here unless you saw a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:05.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.94,0:16:08.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You said it's... food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.24,0:16:09.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Strange, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:12.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have all this money and\Nyet, we're going to starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.45,0:16:17.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's only treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.37,0:16:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.04,0:16:25.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[labored breathing]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.09,0:16:27.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Hey! What's\Ngoing on here, Old Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.55,0:16:29.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's your food?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You had to have eaten something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:31.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.93,0:16:33.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.10,0:16:34.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:35.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:39.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:47.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened to your leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.15,0:16:50.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The food...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:52.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you give me {\i1}all{\i0}\Nof the food you had?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:55.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.79,0:16:58.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And you had to have known\Nthat without that leg,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.66,0:17:00.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'd never be a pirate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:04.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps] You old fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:06.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why'd you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:11.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense to\Nsacrifice so much for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:14.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:16.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:20.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,For my entire life I've\Nhad the same dream as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:25.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The All Blue...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.98,0:17:29.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But... your men said\Nthat it doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.19,0:17:31.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Of course it does!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:32.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never mind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:35.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When the time comes,\Nhead to the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:37.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's where the All\NBlue is sure to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:44.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My days as a pirate are done,\Nbut {\i1}you{\i0} have your whole life to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:46.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:48.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't die, now! Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:50.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Old Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:54.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:56.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.85,0:18:00.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How many men have lost their\Nlives cursing the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:05.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,knowing that it will\Nsoon be their grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:09.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}This isn't the first time I've been\Nhungry enough to look death in the eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:12.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and my thoughts are the same each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.28,0:18:17.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}It is always my deepest wish that there\Nbe a restaurant in the middle of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:18.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] A restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:22.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF] Yeah, I was thinking that if\NI make it out of this mess alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.25,0:18:26.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd like to build a restaurant\Nas my final purpose in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:28.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great! And I'll even help you do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:30.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, don't die, okay? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:31.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A weak little brat like you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:35.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,couldn't be much good for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:37.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll become strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:40.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpers]\NSo... Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.89,0:18:43.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:55.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:57.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The geezer needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.62,0:18:58.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:18:59.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:00.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.74,0:19:02.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:04.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZEFF groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.33,0:19:07.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:12.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Over here! Help us!\NThis way! Please, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fade(0,0,53,0,0,1590,2420)}Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.76,0:19:17.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fade(53,53,220,0,0,0,2580)}Help, help! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.34,0:19:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fade(220,220,255,0,0,0,550)}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.31,0:19:22.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] That old coot...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.93,0:19:26.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He gave up his leg\Nso that I could live!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:29.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.73,0:19:32.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.82,0:19:35.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way to repay the\Nold geezer for his kindness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:37.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,unless I risk my life for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:46.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why? Why are you standing, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.67,0:19:49.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Fraid I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.25,0:19:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's a little too much like giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.76,0:19:55.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOKS gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.22,0:19:57.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiot! They'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.59,0:20:01.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:03.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.39,0:20:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ha! That is so very refined of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.52,0:20:11.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But, this restaurant will be closing soon,\Nand it'll open again for business...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.48,0:20:12.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,... as a pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.98,0:20:14.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.07,0:20:15.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY yells]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:17.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:18.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ghin'll shoot the old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.91,0:20:20.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[PATTY, CARNE gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:21.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[COOK D] What'd he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.70,0:20:26.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.66,0:20:29.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Battle-Axe!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=29}===============================DIALOGUE============================
